OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy day with some rain,
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks patchy and light east
OL,7,Fof Lough Neagh, more persistent in the
OL,8,Fwest where some heavier outbreaks may
OL,9,Fdevelop for the late afternoon.
OL,10,FSoutherly winds strengthening for the
OL,11,Fafternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPersistent rain for evening,
OL,14,Fturning heavier at times, before
OL,15,Fclearing overnight, to leave only a
OL,16,Ffew isolated showers come dawn, these
OL,17,Fmainly across the far west. Brisk
OL,18,Fsoutherly winds easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
